\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.3}{\ignorespaces Normalized squared magnitude distribution of the transverse component of the LG beam ($\ell =1$). The scale bar indicates $0.1$ times the light cone range for WSe$_2$ monolayers, $\bm {Q}_c = 8.6~\mu \mathrm {m}^{-1}$.}}{47}{figure.caption.61}%
